    "text": "<p><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp; is tangent&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo> <mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Comparing tangent with (i) of column-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;satisfied and&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;is obtained which matches for point of contact (P) of column 3 and (III) of column-&nbsp;I.</p>",
